[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d94\"},\"ref\":\"d94\",\"snippet\":\" ... F de Chasseboeuf (1757-1820) Voltaire, (1694-1778) Von Arnim, Elizabeth (1866-1941) von Chamisso, Adelbert (1781-1838) Von Clausewitz, Carl (1780-1831) Von Harbou, Thea (1888-1954) Von Humboldt, Alexander (1769-1859) Von Schiller, Friedrich (1759-1805) Von Schlegel, Augustus Wilhelm (1767-1845) Voynich, E L (1864 ... \",\"title\":\"https://gutenberg.net.au/birthdeath.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d86\"},\"ref\":\"d86\",\"snippet\":\" ... or, the New Englanders by John Neal, published anonymously.\\n* Elizabeth and Her German Garden by Elizabeth von Arnim, originally published anonymously.\\n* Fantasmagoriana by Jean-Baptiste Benoît Eyriès, published anonymously.\\n* Logan by John Neal\\n* Memoirs of a Russian Princess\\n* Might is Right, published under the pseudonym \\\"Ragnar Redbeard\\\". The ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_anonymously_published_works\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"76a86d3f2cc0cc81db499369d2cc799f43d84b073197a0c014ec19b2ee8165ae\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"79b07459c6dba46dc03e9b419419396234cac80445837bcd2c4458f745749bd2\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Isobel Maddison Lucy Morrison Routledge 2018 Elizabeth von Arnim book\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[{\"end\":3000,\"ref\":\"e1\",\"start\":0},{\"end\":3600,\"ref\":\"e2\",\"start\":3300}],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d60\"},\"ref\":\"d60\",\"snippet\":\" ... Insel, 1996, \\n* Isobel Maddison, 'Elizabeth von Arnim: 'Beyond the German Garden,' Routledg