sly_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d7\"},\"ref\":\"d7\",\"snippet\":\" ... She was co-editor of The Translator from 2011-2014 and review editor from 2006-2011. She served as co-editor for the Routledge series New Perspectives in Translation and Interpreting Studies from 2013-2018 and guest-edited The Translator: Bourdieu and the Sociology of Translating and Interpreting ... \",\"title\":\"https://publications-prairial.fr/encounters-in-translation/index.php?id=91\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d29\"},\"ref\":\"d29\",\"snippet\":\" ... Ippolito Desideri's Mission to Tibet (Oxford University Press, 2010) and co-editor (with James Buckley and Frederick Bauerschmidt) of The Blackwell Companion to Catholicism (Wiley-Blackwell, 2007). He is currently working on a critical edition of the Tibetan writings of the Italian Jesuit Ippolito Desideri (1684-1733 ... \",\"title\":\"https://referenceworks.brill.com/display/db/jho?language=en\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"1540f2b3b51a2de95fc1c0fd84378e7147a698d778cdca134d50c84f8217c9cf\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"e085831058f4452921f86f825f806170dbe737fc3912991ac710827f95f3dfa5\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Routledge 2018 Elizabeth von Arnim critical essays co-editor\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_57fe163b61314352b7fa71b7"},{"content":"I have strong evidence that Isobel Maddison is a scholar of Elizabeth von Arnim (an English writer), with a 2012 article in First World War Studies. Now I need to verify the remaining clues: the Routledge 2018 co-edited book, the research group founded in 2009 (coordinator as of December 2023), the panel convenor role, and the PhD. Let me search for her academic profile and the Routledge 2018 book specifically.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Isobel Maddison Lucy Morrison Routledge 2018 Elizabeth von Arnim\", \"Isobel Maddison Anglia Ruskin University Elizabeth von Arnim PhD\", \"Isobel Maddison coordinator research group 2009 convenor panel\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_9052ddd56f6b4ba780eadc6e","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Elizabeth von Arnim Routledge 2018 edited collection essays\", \"Elizabeth von Arnim Reassessment Routledge 2018 editor\", \"Routledge 2018 Elizabeth von Arnim critical essays co-editor\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_b176172c08ed4a82a6662094","index":1,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":true,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[{\"end\":3000,\"ref\":\"e1\",\"start\":0},{\"end\":3600,\"ref\":\"e2\",\"start\":3300}],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d60\"},\"ref\":\"d60\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elizabeth_von_Arnim\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d79\"},\"ref\":\"d79\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1941_in_literature\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d93\"},\"ref\":\"d93\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://www.goodreads.com/topic/show/12077116-the-a-z-of-women-authors\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d94\"},\"ref\":\"d94\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://gutenberg.net.au/birthdeath.html\"},{